<StandardPageLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Painting for Beginners about corrections, accessibility, licensing, partnerships, or a beginner painting question." noindex={true}>
  <h2>We want the guides to be genuinely useful</h2>
  <p>Use the forthcoming owner-approved contact channel to report a factual correction, an accessibility problem, a broken link, or a licensing concern. Helpful reports include the page address, what went wrong, and the device or browser involved when relevant.</p>
  <div class="notice"><strong>Preview status:</strong> The public contact address is awaiting owner confirmation. This page must remain noindex and is a production-signoff blocker until that channel is supplied and tested.</div>
  <h2>Partnerships and products</h2>
  <p>Any future sponsorship, free-product arrangement, or affiliate relationship must be disclosed. We do not promise coverage or positive treatment in exchange for samples.</p>
  <h2>Project-specific help</h2>
  <p>We cannot inspect your home, furniture, or work conditions remotely. For possible hazardous coatings, structural damage, persistent moisture, or high-access work, seek qualified local help.</p>
</StandardPageLayout>
